local.eaptls12fix (1.0.1) stable; urgency=low

  * Add EAP TLS 1.2 Fix, enabling TLS 1.2 for the legacy iOS 5/6
    eapolclient so WPA2-Enterprise networks such as ANU-Secure can
    authenticate. Certificate validation is unchanged.
  * Tested on iPod3,1 iOS 5.1.1 and iPod4,1 iOS 6.1.6.

